{"id":669,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Flabébé wears a crown made from pollen it’s collected from its flower. The crown has hidden healing properties."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s not safe without the power of a flower, but it will keep traveling around until it finds one with the color and shape it wants."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"When it finds a flower it likes, it dwells on that flower its whole life long. It floats in the wind’s embrace with an untroubled heart."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It draws out and controls the hidden power of flowers. The flower Flabébé holds is most likely part of its body."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Flower Veil","hidden":false,"description":"Ally Grass-type Pokémon are protected from status conditions and the lowering of their stats."},{"name":"Symbiosis","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon passes its held item to an ally that has used up an item."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy"],"genderRate":8,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":669,"name":"Flabébé","condition":null,"children":[{"id":670,"name":"Floette","condition":"Lv. 19","children":[{"id":671,"name":"Florges","condition":"Use Shiny Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,22],[1,33],[6,584],[10,219],[15,75],[20,273],[22,345],[24,580],[28,572],[33,235],[37,581],[41,585],[45,80],[48,76]],"machine":[914,226,347,204,886,605,574,577,283,203,412,263,202,447,580,270,113,345,581,572,676,182,94,240,156,402,214,76,500,164,241,129,851,885],"egg":[383,283,715],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv6-86","name":"Flabébé","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","number":"86","artist":"Yukiko Baba","img":"sv6/86"},{"id":"sv1-91","name":"Flabébé","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Common","number":"91","artist":"Mizue","img":"sv1/91"},{"id":"swsh7-71","name":"Flabébé","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"